// Managed by Veyra installer
// Upgrading Asterisk restarts it and drops every call in progress, so
// Ubuntu's nightly unattended upgrade leaves it alone; Veyra installs it in
// the telephony engine's maintenance window, only when no call is up
// (System → Updates; docs/SOFTWARE_UPDATES.md §6). Patterns match the
// start of the package name.
Unattended-Upgrade::Package-Blacklist {
    "asterisk";
    "libpj";
};
